<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quorum Health started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quorum Health started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Quorum Health Group Inc as a buy, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Quorum closed Thursday at 36-5/8.</p>
